WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 10ad7187acecddbe0b148815fa3e3508

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.610
Karibu tena. Sasa, vitendakazi ulivyounda hadi

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.430
sasa hufanya kitu kile kile kila

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:10.760
wakati. turnAround hugeuka kushoto mara mbili kila wakati. shootIfAlienAbove

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:14.180
hukagua na kupiga risasi kila wakati. Lakini fikiria vitendakazi

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.140
ulivyokuwa ukitumia katika kozi yote, jinsi

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:19.480
vinavyofanya mambo tofauti kulingana na maingizo. Rectangle

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.180
inachukua kushoto, juu, upana

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.820
na urefu kama maingizo, kisha huchora mstatili

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:27.040
tofauti kulingana na unachomwambia. Katika

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:29.200
video hii, nitakuonyesha jinsi ya

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:31.920
kuongeza matundu ya ingizo kwenye vitendakazi vyako mwenyewe pia.

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:35.020
Sasa, ili kufanya hivi, unahitaji

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:38.080
kujua mambo mawili. La kwanza ni jinsi hii

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:39.910
inavyoonekana kwa hakika, ni nini unahitaji kuandika, na

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.300
la pili ni kile kinachotokea kwa hakika. Sehemu ya kwanza

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:46.930
ni rahisi kueleweka. Unaongeza tu mabano

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:49.680
ya kawaida, kisha majina ya maingizo yoyote

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:52.720
unayotaka. Kwa hiyo fikiria tunaunda kitendakazi

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:56.400
kinachopaswa kupiga risasi mara nyingi. Hebu

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:01.500
tukiite shootMany. Tungeandika function shootMany, mabano, numShots,

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:06.280
mabano, mabano yaliyopinda, kisha msimbo fulani. Unapotaka

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:08.580
kutumia kitendakazi hiki, ungeandika

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:10.640
shootMany 5 ukitaka kupiga risasi tano,

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:13.180
au shootMany 2 ukitaka

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.840
kutumia risasi mbili. Sasa, hii ndiyo sehemu

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:19.100
muhimu. Msimbo unapoendeshwa, chochote unachoweka

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:23.280
kwenye ingizo hilo, 5 au 2, mini-Jiki, yule aliye na

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:27.080
kofia ndani ya kitendakazi, anachukua ingizo hilo

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:29.880
na kuliweka kwenye sanduku linaloitwa numShots,

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:32.670
kisha analiweka sanduku hilo kwenye rafu

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:34.940
ndani ya kitendakazi ili uweze kulitumia katika

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:39.120
msimbo wa kitendakazi. Hebu niseme tena. Tunapoandika

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:42.110
shootMany 5 kutumia kitendakazi hicho,

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:45.520
Jiki aliye nje anaenda kuchukua

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.040
5 na kuiweka kwenye tundu la ingizo

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:52.800
la shootMany. Ndani ya mashine, mini-Jiki anatoa

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.700
hiyo 5 na kuiweka kwenye sanduku

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:57.180
linaloitwa numShots, kwa sababu hilo ndilo jina

00:01:57.220 --> 00:01:59.340
ulilotoa kwa tundu hilo la ingizo, kisha

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:02.300
anaweka sanduku hilo kwenye rafu ndani ya

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:05.140
kitendakazi kilicho ndani ya mashine. Na kisha ndani ya

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:08.460
kitendakazi, unaweza kutumia tu sanduku la numShots

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:11.360
kama vile ungetumia sanduku lingine lolote. Hakuna

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:14.540
lolote la kichawi kuhusu jina numShots. Tungeweza

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:16.820
kuliita lolote tulilotaka. Ni

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:19.780
maagizo tu kwa mini-Jiki kuunda kila wakati

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:23.020
sanduku lenye lebo hiyo ndani ya

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:25.640
kitendakazi, na kuweka chochote kinachopitishwa kwenye

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:29.750
tundu hilo ndani ya sanduku hilo. Na mara tu unapokuwa na

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:31.170
thamani kwenye sanduku hilo, unaweza kufanya

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:33.590
chochote unachofanya kawaida na masanduku. Sitaki

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:36.380
kufichua mazoezi yajayo, lakini hapa

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:39.100
unaweza kutumia sanduku la numShots ndani ya

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:41.200
repeat kitanzi ili kupiga risasi idadi sahihi

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:44.100
ya mara. Na unaweza kuwa na maingizo zaidi

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:47.340
ya moja pia. Tenganisha tu kwa

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:49.580
koma. Kwa hiyo, ikiwa tuna kitendakazi kinachoitwa

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:52.329
drawStar tunachounda, kinachochora nyota kulingana

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:55.000
na nafasi yake ya juu kushoto, ungeandika function

00:02:55.160 --> 00:03:00.060
drawStar, mabano, left, koma, top, mabano, kisha

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:02.930
mabano yaliyopinda, kisha msimbo wako. Na kisha

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:05.600
kitendakazi kinapoitwa, mini-Jiki ataweka tu

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:07.320
thamani zinazopitishwa kwenye

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:10.660
maingizo kwenye masanduku yenye majina left na top,

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:12.829
kisha ataweka masanduku hayo kwenye rafu ndani ya

00:03:12.829 --> 00:03:16.160
kitendakazi. Nimekuandalia zoezi moja

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.960
linalofuata, nalo ni kuunda upya kitendakazi cha walk

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:21.160
tulichokuwa nacho katika mojawapo ya masomo ya kwanza,

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:24.120
ambapo unaweza kuandika walk 5 ili kusogea

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:27.300
hatua tano mbele. Na hapa utaandika kimsingi

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:29.660
msimbo ule ule kabisa niliouandika

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:31.960
kukitengeneza. Furahia, na tutaonana

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:32.620
hapa tena hivi punde.
